      "signature": "inductive MarkovStep : PositiveBraid → PositiveBraid → Prop | conjugation (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n) (b c : Artin n) : MarkovStep ⟨⟨n, hn⟩, b⟩ ⟨⟨n, hn⟩, c * b * c⁻¹⟩ | positive (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n) (b : Artin n) : MarkovStep ⟨⟨n, hn⟩, b⟩ ⟨⟨n + 1, by omega⟩, strandInclusion n b * lastGenerator n hn⟩ | negative (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n) (b : Artin n) : MarkovStep ⟨⟨n, hn⟩, b⟩ ⟨⟨n + 1, by omega⟩, strandInclusion n b * (lastGenerator n hn)⁻¹⟩ /-- Finite equivalence chains of the actual algebraic Markov moves. -/ abbrev MarkovEquivalent",
      "commit": "8a9135753f8e966382379c101b3934b577c07b4c"
    },
